 ,-1)$ does **not** lie on the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}x.$" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257200 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257201 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257202 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257203 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257204 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257205 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257206 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257207 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1104 #edb/ref 17592186257207 13194139533864 true] [17592186257199 1110 #uuid "521d14d3-bb5b-59f1-841d-5e4bfc9a8b8f" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257200 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257200 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257200 1111 #uuid "ded3f952-61f0-5925-b863-e6ac4a7f0ea8" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257201 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257201 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257201 1111 #uuid "e3e7a484-226e-585a-9c51-6c1fdb3b87b8" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257202 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257202 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257202 1111 #uuid "6d4c73ce-b35e-58d9-a14f-bb9a593ff60c" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257203 1034 "I only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257203 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257203 1111 #uuid "44d360d7-afd6-5a05-b302-8665c4b431ef" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257204 1034 "III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257204 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257204 1111 #uuid "87ff9f03-9dce-54ed-8b24-c3705b8c5234" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257205 1034 "I and II only" 13194139533864 true] [17