\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand this is a $p$-series with $p=2.$ Since $p>1,$ the series converges by the $p$-series test.\n\n- For the second series, we have\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{{n}^{5}}=\\sqrt{3}\\cdot {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{{n}^{5}}\n$$\n\n \nwhich is a $p$-series with $p=5.$ Since $p>1,$ the series converges by the $p$-series test.\n\n- For the third series, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{n\\sqrt[3]{n}}{\\sqrt[4]{{n}^{7}}} & ={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{n\\cdot {n}^{1/3}}{{n}^{7/4}} \\\\  & ={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{{n}^{5/12}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand this is a $p$-series with $p=\\frac{5}{12}.$ Since $p\\le 1,$ the series is divergent.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257788 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257789 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257790 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257791 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257792 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257793 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257794 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1000 #edb/ref 17592186257795 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1104 #edb/ref 17592186257793 13194139533864 true] [17592186257787 1110 #uuid "334686ca-1c54-5ac9-b7f3-b0b671401645" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257788 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257788 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257788 1111 #uuid "7819d449-01e9-5b16-a26a-433627b519ca" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257789 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186257789 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186257789 1111 #uuid "9d253ade-e26c-5024-98c2-c679