(n!)^{2}}{{4}^{n}\\cdot (n+1)^{2}\\cdot (n!)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{4}^{n}}\\cdot 4\\cdot \\cancel{(n!)^{2}}}{\\cancel{{4}^{n}}\\cdot (n+1)^{2}\\cdot \\cancel{(n!)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{(n+1)^{2}} \\\\  & \\le 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, whereas statement III is true. Since $0<L\\le 1$ for all $n\\ge 1,$ we can conclude that the sequence ${a}_{n}$ is decreasing.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258256 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258257 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258258 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258259 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258260 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258261 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258262 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258263 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1104 #edb/ref 17592186258258 13194139533864 true] [17592186258255 1110 #uuid "1d02046d-dcc0-55e3-b215-0b49df87464b" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258256 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258256 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258256 1111 #uuid "f035b59d-56fd-5dba-988d-37888866bd02" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258257 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258257 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258257 1111 #uuid "d324918d-7802-5d47-bc42-7d49df0d1749" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258258 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258258 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258258 1111 #uuid "e34f9685-cbe2-5a01-bd9c-ec1bc7e40922" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258259 1034 "I only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258259 1103 #edb/ref 175921