n $K<0.$ \n\nTherefore, the series  \n\n$$\n\\sqrt{K}\\cdot {\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\n$$\n\nis convergent for $K\\ge 0.$" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258441 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258442 13194139533864 true] [17592186258441 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533864 true] [17592186258441 1041 "answer" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258441 1104 #edb/ref 17592186258442 13194139533864 true] [17592186258441 1110 #uuid "7108e05b-40b5-5609-a877-97c722210967" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258442 1034 "K\\ge 0" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258442 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533864 true] [17592186258442 1111 #uuid "e30e1205-c74c-594c-a807-fe9653a44b37" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258443 1017 #edb/ref 17592186258444 13194139533864 true] [17592186258443 1089 "q-156904" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258443 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533864 true] [17592186258443 1100 "Given that ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is divergent, determine all real values of $K$ for which ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({K}^{3}+1)\\cdot {a}_{n}$ is divergent.\n\nAnswer: {{answer}}" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258443 1113 #uuid "4b57d0b6-bc38-5056-bac4-445ec8a4f7ab" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258443 1145 "If we multiply the terms of a divergent series by a non-zero constant, the resulting series is divergent.\n\nTherefore, the series \n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({K}^{3}+1)\\cdot {a}_{n}\n$$\n\nis divergent when\n\n$$\n{K}^{3}+1\\ne 0\\,\\Rightarrow \\,K\\ne -1.\n$$" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258444 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258445 13194139533864 true] [17592186258444 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533864 true] [17592186258444 1041 "answer" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258444 1104 #edb/ref 17592186258445 13194139533864 true] [17592186258444 1110 #uuid "9d0e5ddd-5c7f-5387-a7f8-e996a7859b62" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258445 1034 "{K}^{3}+1\\ne 0\\,\\Rightarrow \\,K\\ne -1" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258445 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533864 tru