49 1113 #uuid "11a1973e-aa91-5290-99cf-1bd17e28a67e" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258449 1145 "Removing the first $k-1$ terms from a convergent series results in a convergent series.\n\nMore precisely, assume that $k\\ge 1$ is an integer. Then, we have the following:\n\n*If ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is convergent, then ${\\sum }_{n=k}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is also convergent.*\n\nSo, since ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is convergent, we have that ${\\sum }_{n=85}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is also convergent." 13194139533864 true] [17592186258450 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258451 13194139533864 true] [17592186258450 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258452 13194139533864 true] [17592186258450 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186258450 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258450 1104 #edb/ref 17592186258452 13194139533864 true] [17592186258450 1110 #uuid "9a1e69e2-802e-563b-bdb3-25096f2cfd9f" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258451 1034 "Diverges" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258451 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258451 1111 #uuid "6fa0482b-bb1b-5a8f-8260-7563e97283f5" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258452 1034 "Converges" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258452 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258452 1111 #uuid "7d42eba7-2ff3-503d-b95d-6b7eb6cdb43f" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258453 1017 #edb/ref 17592186258454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258453 1089 "q-157061" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258453 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533864 true] [17592186258453 1100 "Given that ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is convergent, which of the following is true regarding the series ${\\sum }_{n=500}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}?$" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258453 1113 #uuid "7099c532-a199-562f-8bf0-7842daffe958" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258453 1145 "Removing the first $k-1$ terms from a convergent series results in a convergent series.\n\nMore precisely, assume that $k\\ge 1$ is an integer. Then, we have the following:\n\n*If ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is convergent, then ${\\sum }_{n=k}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is also convergent.*\n\nSo, since ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is convergent, we have that ${\\sum }_{n=500}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is also convergent." 13194139533864 true] [17592186258454 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258455 13194139533864 true] [17592186258454 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258456 13194139533864 true] [17592186258454 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186258454 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258454 1104 #edb/ref 17592186258456 13194139533864 true] [17592186258454 1110 #uuid "eae1f70e-1856-5bde-9d2c-039fc97bbfad" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258455 1034 "Diverges" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258455 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258455 1111 #uuid "9db9ea89-a83c-5057-b773-9aa10be347d1" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258456 1034 "Converges" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258456 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258456 1111 #uuid "1f9a4799-774c-58ae-8944-640de36765c6" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258457 1017 #edb/ref 17592186258458 13194139533864 true] [17592186258457 1089 "q-157090" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258457 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533864 true] [17592186258457 1100 "Given that ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is divergent, which of the following statements are true regarding the series ${\\sum }_{n=k}^{\\infty }{a}_{n},$ where $k$ is a positive integer, and ${a}_{n}$ is well-defined for all $n⩾1?$\n\nI. - It is convergent for $k>{5}^{10}$\nII. - It is divergent for all $k$\nIII. - It is convergent for $1<k<5$" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258457 1113 #uuid "5b4cfd7c-15a9-5ca2-973b-6cc59e5854a8" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258457 1145 "Removing the first $k-1$ terms from a divergent series results in a divergent series.\n\nMore precisely, assume ${a}_{n}$ is well-defined for $n\\ge 1$ and $k\\ge 1$ is an integer. Then, we have the following:\n\n*If ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is divergent, then ${\\sum }_{n=k}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is also divergent.*\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258459 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258460 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258461 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258462 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258463 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258464 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258465 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258466 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1104 #edb/ref 17592186258466 13194139533864 true] [17592186258458 1110 #uuid "5cba780f-da49-5d1d-9545-cc0c4c913504" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258459 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258459 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258459 1111 #uuid "57bd7a51-284e-5b66-b11f-cde3b70a46a6" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258460 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258460 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258460 1111 #uuid "df193af6-a205-5fbc-9010-7c149cf0304f" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258461 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258461 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258461 1111 #uuid "dacc62f4-43bc-5b7b-a941-026a75dd859f" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258462 1034 "I only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258462 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258462 1111 #uuid "a9501a14-d84d-5471-8838-5b058134ca7e" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258463 1034 "III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258463 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258463 1111 #uuid "b7165fbb-94c