{n}$ is convergent, then ${\\sum }_{n=k}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is also convergent.\n\nWith that in mind, let's analyze each statement:\n\n- Statement I is true. The sum of two convergent series is convergent.\n\n- Statement II is true. Any constant multiple of a convergent series gives a convergent series.\n\n- Statement III is true. Removing a finite number of terms from a convergent series gives a convergent series.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258479 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258480 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258481 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258482 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258483 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258484 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258485 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258486 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1104 #edb/ref 17592186258479 13194139533864 true] [17592186258478 1110 #uuid "8be80c42-2a5c-53e9-a30e-081f4ccc8721" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258479 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258479 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258479 1111 #uuid "90b6a9cd-a484-529a-8eae-d44c92b7b4c9" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258480 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258480 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258480 1111 #uuid "655f0d00-2dac-5a33-bc59-177ca995b0a3" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258481 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258481 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258481 1111 #uuid "7666f9cc-0edd-5246-9564-e920e7845834" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258482 1034 "I only" 13194139533864 true] [1759218625848