 }{b}_{n}$ is convergent, then ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{b}_{n}$ is convergent.\n\n- If ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is convergent, then ${\\sum }_{n=k}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is also convergent.\n\nWith that in mind, let's analyze each statement:\n\n- Statement I is true. Any constant multiple of a convergent series gives a convergent series.\n\n- Statement II is true. Removing a finite number of terms from a convergent series gives a convergent series.\n\n- Statement III is true. The sum of two convergent series is convergent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\"" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258489 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258490 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258491 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258492 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258493 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258494 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258495 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1000 #edb/ref 17592186258496 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1041 "selection" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1104 #edb/ref 17592186258489 13194139533864 true] [17592186258488 1110 #uuid "97c7de96-9ab6-5150-97bd-53fbe2330f76" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258489 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258489 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258489 1111 #uuid "e030cded-26f1-5e3b-9d46-4d301b12cffb" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258490 1034 "II and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258490 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] [17592186258490 1111 #uuid "08133c87-65a8-5b63-8453-50e84304f73f" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258491 1034 "I and III only" 13194139533864 true] [17592186258491 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139533864 true] 