7592186261991 13194139533864 true] [17592186261990 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533864 true] [17592186261990 1041 "y" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261990 1104 #edb/ref 17592186261991 13194139533864 true] [17592186261990 1110 #uuid "692c0975-83dd-5e12-b8d5-3f74e2e8e1e1" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261991 1034 "3" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261991 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533864 true] [17592186261991 1111 #uuid "f22c16fc-f6c1-5051-834f-8ea7f4851607" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261992 1017 #edb/ref 17592186261993 13194139533864 true] [17592186261992 1089 "q-92999" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261992 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533864 true] [17592186261992 1100 "Find the root of $f(x)=2(5)^{3x+2}-54.$\n\nAnswer: {{answer}}" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261992 1113 #uuid "c691be89-e87d-5ee6-84ce-a546298e0812" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261992 1145 "To find the root of $f(x),$  we must solve $f(x)=0:$\n\n$$\n2(5)^{3x+2}-54=0\n$$\n\nFirst, we isolate the term with the variable exponent by adding $54$ to both sides:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(5)^{3x+2}-54 & =0 \\\\ 2(5)^{3x+2}-\\cancel{54}+\\cancel{54} & =0+54 \\\\ 2(5)^{3x+2} & =54\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDividing both sides by $2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(5)^{3x+2} & =54 \\\\ {5}^{3x+2} & =27.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we rewrite $27$ as ${3}^{3}$ to get\n\n$$\n{5}^{3x+2}={3}^{3}.\n$$\n\nThen we take ${log}_{5}$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{5}^{3x+2} & ={3}^{3} \\\\ {log}_{5}({5}^{3x+2}) & ={log}_{5}({3}^{3}) \\\\ 3x+2 & =3{log}_{5}(3)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x+2 & =3{log}_{5}(3) \\\\ 3x & =3{log}_{5}(3)-2 \\\\ x & =\\frac{3{log}_{5}(3)-2}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261993 1000 #edb/ref 17592186261994 13194139533864 true] [17592186261993 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533864 true] [17592186261993 1041 "answer" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261993 1104 #edb/ref 17592186261994 13194139533864 true] [17592186261993 1110 #uuid "94cc5532-74c7-54ff-ba0c-644ec56ed95f" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261994 1034 "\\frac{3{log}_{5}(3)-2}{3}" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261994 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533864 true] [17592186261994 1111 #uuid "a738db25-7622-5892-97cc-93199b49b88b" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261995 1017 #edb/ref 17592186261996 13194139533864 true] [17592186261995 1089 "q-93100" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261995 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139533864 true] [17592186261995 1100 "Find the root of $f(x)=3\\sqrt[6]{3x+13}-6.$\n\nAnswer: {{answer}}" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261995 1113 #uuid "915a85d2-04ba-5d69-9940-b94e85fbc1dd" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261995 1145 "To find the root of $f(x),$  we must solve $f(x)=0:$\n\n$$\n3\\sqrt[6]{3x+13}-6=0\n$$\n\nWe solve this equation by making $x$ the subject, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\sqrt[6]{3x+13}-6 & =0 \\\\ 3\\sqrt[6]{3x+13} & =6 \\\\ \\sqrt[6]{3x+13} & =2 \\\\ (\\sqrt[6]{3x+13})^{6} & ={2}^{6} \\\\ 3x+13 & =64 \\\\ 3x & =51 \\\\ x & =17\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we must check the answer by substituting it back into the initial equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\sqrt[6]{3\\cdot 17+13}-6 & =0 \\\\ 3\\sqrt[6]{64}-6 & =0 \\\\ 3\\cdot 2-6 & =0 \\\\ 0 & =0\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the root of $f(x)$ is $x=17.$" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261996 1000 #edb/ref 17592186261997 13194139533864 true] [17592186261996 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533864 true] [17592186261996 1041 "answer" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261996 1104 #edb/ref 17592186261997 13194139533864 true] [17592186261996 1110 #uuid "f665c510-5191-5119-81c5-8160fe67a91d" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261997 1034 "17" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261997 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533864 true] [17592186261997 1111 #uuid "0753cec7-4d3b-5556-880e-87974e8a09cf" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261998 1017 #edb/ref 17592186261999 13194139533864 true] [17592186261998 1089 "q-9331" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261998 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533864 true] [17592186261998 1100 "Determine whether the series\n${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{4}{\\sqrt[6]{{n}^{5}}}$\nconverges or diverges.\n\nAnswer: {{answer}}" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261998 1113 #uuid "6f9c004d-c216-5608-ad21-162c3e1dd45a" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261998 1145 "The series can be written as\n\n$$\n4{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{{n}^{5/6}},\n$$\n\nwhich is a $p$-series with $p=\\frac{5}{6}.$ Since $p\\le 1,$ the series is divergent.\n\nNote that the factor of $4$ multiplying the series has no effect on the convergence/divergence of the series." 13194139533864 true] [17592186261999 1000 #edb/ref 17592186262000 13194139533864 true] [17592186261999 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533864 true] [17592186261999 1041 "answer" 13194139533864 true] [17592186261999 1104 #edb/ref 17592186262000 13194139533864 true] [17592186261999 1110 #uuid "1b342020-669f-5e04-8b85-dfad9597da56" 13194139533864 true] [17592186262000 1034 "4" 13194139533864 true] [17592186262000 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533864 true] [17592186262000 1111 #uuid "333eb865-1aff-5b94-a5c8-384293d669d8" 13194139533864 true] [17592186262001 1017 #edb/ref 17592186262002 13194139533864 true] [17592186262001 1089 "q-9332" 13194139533864 true] [17592186262001 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533864 true] [17592186262001 1100 "Determine whether the series\n${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt[8]{{n}^{7}}}$\nconverges or diverges.\n\nAnswer: {{answer}}" 13194139533864 true] [17592186262001 1113 #uuid "e09514d4-1e05-5fb3-ba5a-f0e56cf060c9" 13194139533864 true] [17592186262001 1145 "The series can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{{n}^{7/8}},\n$$\n\nwhich is a $p$-series with $p=\\frac{7}{8}.$ Since $p\\le 1$, the series is divergent. \n\nNote that the factor of $\\frac{1}{2}$ multiplying the series has no effect on the conve